WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.300 --> 00:00:03.867
Running a growing business shouldn't feel like this.

2
00:00:04.417 --> 00:00:06.184
Orders arrive by email.

3
00:00:06.304 --> 00:00:08.114
Stock lives in spreadsheets.

4
00:00:08.234 --> 00:00:10.151
Approvals get lost in chat.

5
00:00:10.751 --> 00:00:13.457
Every team keeps its own version of the truth.

6
00:00:13.577 --> 00:00:19.213
The same data is typed in, again and again, and mistakes are found when it's already too late.

7
00:00:19.863 --> 00:00:22.639
Big ERP systems promise to fix this.

8
00:00:22.759 --> 00:00:27.606
