9
00:00:28.306 --> 00:00:29.592
There's a better way.

10
00:00:31.092 --> 00:00:33.491
Meet BOH ERP.

11
00:00:33.611 --> 00:00:37.822
One connected platform, set up around how your business already works.

12
00:00:38.422 --> 00:00:45.835
Sales, purchasing, inventory, production, quality, dispatch, finance and support, all sharing the same data.

13
00:00:45.955 --> 00:00:48.545
Enter it once, and every team can use it.

14
00:00:49.545 --> 00:00:55.089
When a customer's order email arrives, BOH ERP reads it for you.

15
00:00:55.209 --> 00:00:57.351
One click turns it into a project.

16
00:00:59.351 --> 00:01:04.076
Drawings, materials, production and quality move forward step by step.

17
00:01:04.196 --> 00:01:09.984
Nothing ships until every check has passed, and the invoice is ready the moment the order leaves.

18
00:01:10.984 --> 00:01:13.970
Every morning, you see what needs attention first.

19
00:01:14.090 --> 00:01:17.202
Late deliveries, low stock, and waiting approvals.

20
00:01:18.102 --> 00:01:26.189
Whether you manufacture, sell online, or run a software company, BOH ERP adapts to your industry.

21
00:01:26.309 --> 00:01:27.843
Not the other way round.

22
00:01:28.743 --> 00:01:30.416
Getting started is simple.

23
